# Must: structure · components · mobile

Full tree + Home map: **`project-structure.mdc`**.

## 1. Folder structure (must)

Do not dump UI into `page.tsx`.

| Put here | What |
|----------|------|
| `src/app/<route>/page.tsx` | Thin page: compose sections only |
| `src/components/home/` or `components/<landing>/` | Page sections |
| `src/components/layout/` | Header, Footer, shells |
| `src/components/brand/` | Logos / marks |
| `src/components/forms/` | react-hook-form components |
| `src/components/ui/` | Reusable primitives |
| `src/components/seo/` | JSON-LD / SEO widgets |
| `src/data/` | Static copy (no secrets) |
| `src/config/` | `site`, `brand` tokens/paths |
| `src/lib/` | Helpers (SEO, utils) |
| `public/` | Images, videos, asset packs |

New landing: `src/app/<slug>/page.tsx` + `src/components/<slug>/` + `src/data/<slug>.ts`. Import via `@/`.

## 2. Component-based code (must)

- One section = one component file
- Extract shared UI into `ui/*` before duplicating
- `"use client"` only where needed (nav, motion, Swiper, forms, measured UI)
- Copy → `src/data/*`; paths/colors → `src/config/*` + CSS vars
- No god-files mixing unrelated sections
- Named export per section (`export function Hero`)

## 3. Mobile responsive (must)

- Mobile-first; then `sm:` / `md:` / `lg:` / `xl:`
- Verify **320 / 390 / 768 / 1024 / 1280+** before done
- No horizontal scroll: `min-w-0`, `max-w-full`, `overflow-x-clip`
- Touch-friendly CTAs; full-width buttons OK on phone
- Never ship desktop-only then shrink. Details: `ui-responsive.mdc`

## Never

- Giant `page.tsx` with all section markup
- Hardcoded brand strings outside config/data
- Desktop-only layouts
- Copy-paste sections instead of components
- Parallel trees like `src/sections` or `src/views`
